{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Mercury Retrograde"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Communication Breakdown"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le17ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Narrative Tenses: Simple Past, Past Continuous, Past Perfect  and Past Perfect Continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Narrative tenses are the tenses that you use to talk about past events and to tell stories. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The most common narrative tense is the Simple Past. Three other tenses, Past Continuous, the Past Perfect and the Past Perfect Continuous can help you say what you want more efficiently. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "It is often useful to look at these tenses together within the context of the function narrating, i.e. relating past events."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Completed Actions/<br/> Routines in the past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I was on my way to New York. <br/> I waited for two hours to get a taxi that I had to share with four strangers. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Actions in progress in the past/background story/two actions happening at the same time in the past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I was reading my book and waiting to board when I heard an announcement.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" An action that happened before another past action\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> A huge snow storm had hit Washington and the train that was supposed to take us to New York got stuck in a snow drift! </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Perfect Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" An action that was in progress before another past action\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I called the airlines but they had been cancelling flights all day.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Speculating About the Past"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use Perfect modals to speculate about things that happened in the past. Speculation means guessing about what happened in the past. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You form the Perfect modals by using this structure:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "subject  + modal + <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + past participle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">The tech <span class=\"strong\">must have thought</span> I was crazy.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here, <span class=\"italic\">must have</span> implies a strong certainty that the tech thought they were crazy."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">That <span class=\"strong\">might have been</span> why my texts weren't being sent.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here, <span class=\"italic\">might have</span> implies less certainty about what happened in the past."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The tech must have thought I was crazy."}, {"type": "example", "content": "That might have been why my texts weren't being sent. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You must have been exhausted. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He must have been an astronomy student. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "If I had remembered that, I wouldn't have bothered to go to the shop. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Mercury"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the planet nearest to the sun"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What did you say about Mercury back there?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about coincidences and strange events."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "retrograde"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an illusion in which a planet appears to be traveling backward "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I said Mercury's in retrograde."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "backwards"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "movement away from one's front"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It looks like it's going backwards in the sky."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have to do with something"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "involved or connected with"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: But what does this have to do with your phone and computer?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to not bother to do something"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make no effort to do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  If I had remembered that, I wouldn't have bothered to go to the shop."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "snow drift"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a deep bank of snow heaped by the wind"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The train that was supposed to take us to New York got stuck in a snow drift! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "snowstorm"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a storm which brings a lot of snow and strong winds"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That kind of snowstorm is not unusual on the East coast."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think about a trip that you took that had lots of problems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a story about the experience and all the things that went wrong. (If you can't think of a true story, make one up.)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Exchange stories with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your partner's story and correct any errors you find."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a story about a travel disaster."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read a partner's story."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make corrections to my partner's story."}]}], "labs": [{"type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "title": "", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le17ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le17ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter ...  what did you say about Mercury back there?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I said Mercury's in retrograde. That explains the problems I've been having.  If I had remembered that, I wouldn't have bothered to go to the shop. The tech must have thought I was crazy.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What are you talking about?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The planet Mercury rules communication, clear thinking, truth and travel, so when the planet goes retrograde - which means that it looks like it's going backwards in the sky \u2014 all those things go backwards. It happens for a couple of weeks, three times a year.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : Okay. But what does this have to do with your phone and computer?", "id": 1}, {"time": "42000", "image": "engenn10le17ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, if communication is going backwards then that might have been why my texts weren't being sent. When Mercury is in retrograde, things get a bit crazy.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Do you really believe that?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes! Last time Mercury was in retrograde, I was on my way to New York. I was traveling by train and I got to the station early. I was reading my book and waiting to board when I heard an announcement. A huge snowstorm had hit Washington and the train that was supposed to take us to New York got stuck in a snow drift! I tried to rent a car but the police had shut down the highways. I called the airlines but they had been cancelling flights all day. I waited for 2 hours to get a taxi that I had to share with 4 strangers.", "id": 2}, {"time": "89000", "image": "engenn10le17ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow! You must have been exhausted.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I was. But I remember someone in the taxi talking about Mercury retrograde. He must have been an astronomy student.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That kind of snowstorm is not unusual on the East coast. What makes you think it was caused by a planet going backwards?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It was September.", "id": 3}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob05re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss coincidences and strange events."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can say what happened and what was happening, what had happened, and what had been happening."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can speculate about the past. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What do you know about astronomy and the planets?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you think it is possible for the other planets to affect what happens on Earth? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct"}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "The planet is going retrograde!"}], "id": 0}, {"type": "STI", "stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 